      {
        "documentPage": 115,
        "printedPage": 110,
        "readVisually": true,
        "finding": "印110，字词句运用续：高兴、生气、害怕、难过，联系生活说和写。日积月累：明·唐寅《画鸡》，从红冠、雪白和叫声理解画面。",
        "path": "output/courseware-lessons/pep-chinese-g1-lower-language-garden-eight/official/textbook/ebook-115.jpg",
        "sha256": "df833b58492828152ff977f2d3b156aa377d67ef6fcf8bf06852631106e68e27",
        "bytes": 278772
