      {
        "documentPage": 116,
        "printedPage": 111,
        "readVisually": true,
        "finding": "印111，和大人一起读胡木仁《小熊住山洞》：一家住在山洞，熊爸爸想砍树盖房。春天见花，夏天见绿叶，小熊两次劝留。",
        "path": "output/courseware-lessons/pep-chinese-g1-lower-language-garden-eight/official/textbook/ebook-116.jpg",
        "sha256": "38f53cbd9b46e67435de163e80175e2f0edecfc409fc7d0c292ae0053e17a57a",
        "bytes": 574423
      },
      {
        "documentPage": 117,
        "printedPage": 112,
        "readVisually": true,
        "finding": "印112，秋天见果，冬天听鸟声、见树上的鸟家，再劝熊爸爸不砍树。",
        "path": "output/courseware-lessons/pep-chinese-g1-lower-language-garden-eight/official/textbook/ebook-117.jpg",
